{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"AI Meal Planning Service","description":"AI-powered meal planning and nutrition optimization service","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/health/":{"get":{"tags":["health"],"summary":"Healthcheck","operationId":"healthcheck_api_health__get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Response Healthcheck Api Health  Get"}}}}}}},"/api/meal-planning/generate":{"post":{"tags":["meal-planning"],"summary":"Generate AI Meal Plan","description":"Generate an AI-powered meal plan for a user.\n\nThis endpoint receives user data from the Node.js backend and generates\na personalized meal plan based on dietary preferences, health metrics,\nand nutritional targets.","operationId":"generate_meal_plan_api_meal_planning_generate_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GenerateMealPlanRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealPlanResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/user-profile/analyze":{"post":{"tags":["user-analysis"],"summary":"Analyze User Profile","description":"Analyze user profile and calculate health metrics.\n\nThis endpoint receives user profile data from the Node.js backend and:\n- Calculates BMR (Basal Metabolic Rate)\n- Calculates TDEE (Total Daily Energy Expenditure)\n- Calculates target calories based on health goals\n- Determines BMI and body category\n- Provides personalized recommendations\n\nThe backend should save these results to the database.\n\n**Sequence:**\n1. Backend loads user profile + health data from DB\n2. Backend calls this endpoint with profile data\n3. AI Core calculates BMR, TDEE, metabolic metrics\n4. Returns structured analysis result\n5. Backend saves analysis result to DB","operationId":"analyze_user_profile_endpoint_api_user_profile_analyze_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserProfileRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserProfileAnalysisResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/pipeline/complete-pipeline":{"post":{"tags":["AI Pipeline"],"summary":"Execute Complete AI Meal Planning Pipeline","description":"Execute the complete 3-step AI meal planning pipeline:\n    \n    **Step 1: Analyze Dietary Preferences**\n    - Normalizes diet types and excluded ingredients\n    - Validates against supported diet list\n    - Output: diet_constraints\n    \n    **Step 2: Analyze Health Goals**\n    - Interprets health objective (weight loss, muscle gain, etc.)\n    - Calculates calorie adjustment and target calories\n    - Determines macro priorities\n    - Output: goal_profile\n    \n    **Step 3: Generate Personalized Meal Plan (Core)**\n    - Filters recipes by diet constraints\n    - Matches target calories within ±10% tolerance\n    - Distributes macros across meals\n    - Assembles complete meal plan\n    - Output: meal_plan\n    \n    Returns results from all 3 steps plus metadata.","operationId":"execute_complete_pipeline_api_pipeline_complete_pipeline_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealPlanPipelineRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealPlanPipelineResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/pipeline/step1/analyze-dietary-preferences":{"post":{"tags":["AI Pipeline","Pipeline Steps"],"summary":"Step 1: Analyze Dietary Preferences","description":"Analyze dietary preferences and produce normalized diet constraints.\n    \n    This is Function 1 of the pipeline, exposed as a standalone endpoint.\n    \n    **Purpose**: Build diet constraints for meal planning\n    \n    **Processing**:\n    - Normalize all ingredient names to lowercase\n    - Merge allergies + disliked_ingredients\n    - Remove duplicates\n    - Validate diet_types against supported list\n    \n    **Output**: Clean structured diet_constraints object","operationId":"analyze_dietary_preferences_endpoint_api_pipeline_step1_analyze_dietary_preferences_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DietaryPreferencesInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DietaryPreferencesOutput"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/pipeline/step2/analyze-health-goals":{"post":{"tags":["AI Pipeline","Pipeline Steps"],"summary":"Step 2: Analyze Health Goals","description":"Analyze health goals and produce goal profile with calorie/macro strategy.\n    \n    This is Function 2 of the pipeline, exposed as a standalone endpoint.\n    \n    **Purpose**: Define optimization direction for meal planning\n    \n    **Processing**:\n    - Map goal to calorie adjustment\n    - Compute target calories from TDEE\n    - Apply safe bounds (no extreme deficit/surplus)\n    - Determine macro priorities\n    \n    **Output**: goal_profile with numeric nutrition targets","operationId":"analyze_health_goals_endpoint_api_pipeline_step2_analyze_health_goals_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthGoalInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthGoalOutput"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/pipeline/step3/generate-meal-plan":{"post":{"tags":["AI Pipeline","Pipeline Steps"],"summary":"Step 3: Generate Personalized Meal Plan (Core)","description":"Generate personalized meal plan using metabolic data and constraints.\n    \n    This is Function 3 of the pipeline - the CORE AI engine.\n    \n    **Purpose**: Assemble meals that satisfy nutrition targets and restrictions\n    \n    **Processing**:\n    - Filter recipes by diet constraints\n    - Match target calories within ±10%\n    - Distribute macros across meals\n    - Select high-score recipes\n    - Balance nutrition\n    \n    **Output**: Complete meal_plan with meals and nutrition totals\n    \n    **Note**: Requires outputs from Step 1 and Step 2 as inputs","operationId":"generate_meal_plan_endpoint_api_pipeline_step3_generate_meal_plan_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealPlanGenerationInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealPlanGenerationOutput"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/pipeline/supported-diet-types":{"get":{"tags":["AI Pipeline","Utilities"],"summary":"Get Supported Diet Types","description":"Returns list of all supported diet types for Step 1","operationId":"get_supported_diet_types_api_pipeline_supported_diet_types_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/":{"get":{"summary":"Root","operationId":"root__get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AnalysisSummary":{"properties":{"bmr_explanation":{"type":"string","title":"Bmr Explanation"},"tdee_explanation":{"type":"string","title":"Tdee Explanation"},"target_explanation":{"type":"string","title":"Target Explanation"}},"type":"object","required":["bmr_explanation","tdee_explanation","target_explanation"],"title":"AnalysisSummary","description":"Human-readable explanations"},"BodyProfile":{"properties":{"age":{"type":"integer","title":"Age","description":"Age in years"},"gender":{"type":"string","title":"Gender","description":"Gender (male/female/other)"},"bmi":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Bmi","description":"Body Mass Index (from upstream)"},"bmr":{"type":"number","title":"Bmr","description":"Basal Metabolic Rate (calories/day)"},"tdee":{"type":"number","title":"Tdee","description":"Total Daily Energy Expenditure (calories/day)"},"activity_level":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Activity Level","description":"Activity level (from upstream)"},"weight_kg":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Weight Kg","description":"Current weight in kg"},"height_cm":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Height Cm","description":"Height in cm"}},"type":"object","required":["age","gender","bmr","tdee"],"title":"BodyProfile","description":"User's metabolic profile from upstream 'Analyze User Profile' function.\n\nThis model matches the output of the existing analyzeUserProfile function.\nDo NOT recalculate BMR/TDEE if already provided - trust the upstream calculation."},"DietConstraints":{"properties":{"diet_types":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Diet Types","description":"Validated diet types"},"excluded_ingredients":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Excluded Ingredients","description":"Combined allergies and dislikes (normalized)"}},"type":"object","title":"DietConstraints","description":"Normalized diet constraints from dietary preferences analysis"},"DietaryPreferencesInput":{"properties":{"diet_types":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Diet Types","description":"List of diet types (e.g., ['keto', 'vegan'])"},"allergies":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Allergies","description":"List of allergen ingredients"},"disliked_ingredients":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Disliked Ingredients","description":"List of disliked ingredients"}},"type":"object","title":"DietaryPreferencesInput","description":"Input for dietary preferences analysis"},"DietaryPreferencesOutput":{"properties":{"diet_constraints":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DietConstraints","description":"Normalized diet constraints for meal planning"}},"type":"object","required":["diet_constraints"],"title":"DietaryPreferencesOutput","description":"Output from dietary preferences analysis"},"GenerateMealPlanRequest":{"properties":{"user_id":{"type":"string","title":"User Id","description":"User ID from the backend"},"days":{"type":"integer","maximum":30.0,"minimum":1.0,"title":"Days","description":"Number of days for the meal plan","default":7},"use_ml":{"type":"boolean","title":"Use Ml","description":"Whether to use ML/LLM features","default":false},"user_data":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"User Data","description":"Optional user data including profile, preferences, and health metrics"}},"type":"object","required":["user_id"],"title":"GenerateMealPlanRequest"},"GoalProfile":{"properties":{"primary_goal":{"type":"string","title":"Primary Goal","description":"Primary health goal"},"calorie_adjustment":{"type":"number","title":"Calorie Adjustment","description":"Daily calorie adjustment from TDEE (negative=deficit, positive=surplus)"},"target_calories":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Calories","description":"Target daily calories (if TDEE provided)"},"protein_priority":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MacroPriority","description":"Protein intake priority level"},"fat_priority":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MacroPriority","description":"Fat intake priority level"},"carb_priority":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MacroPriority","description":"Carbohydrate intake priority level"}},"type":"object","required":["primary_goal","calorie_adjustment","protein_priority","fat_priority","carb_priority"],"title":"GoalProfile","description":"Goal profile with calorie and macro strategy"},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"HealthGoalInput":{"properties":{"health_goal":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthGoalType","description":"Primary health objective"},"target_weight":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Weight","description":"Target weight in kg (optional)"},"timeline_weeks":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","maximum":52.0,"minimum":1.0},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Timeline Weeks","description":"Timeline to achieve goal in weeks (optional)"},"user_tdee":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"User Tdee","description":"User's Total Daily Energy Expenditure (optional but preferred)"}},"type":"object","required":["health_goal"],"title":"HealthGoalInput","description":"Input for health goals analysis"},"HealthGoalOutput":{"properties":{"goal_profile":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GoalProfile","description":"Computed goal profile for meal planning"}},"type":"object","required":["goal_profile"],"title":"HealthGoalOutput","description":"Output from health goals analysis"},"HealthGoalType":{"type":"string","enum":["weight_loss","muscle_gain","maintain","aggressive_weight_loss"],"title":"HealthGoalType","description":"Supported health goals"},"HealthMetricsResponse":{"properties":{"bmr":{"type":"number","title":"Bmr","description":"Basal Metabolic Rate in calories/day"},"tdee":{"type":"number","title":"Tdee","description":"Total Daily Energy Expenditure in calories/day"},"target_calories":{"type":"number","title":"Target Calories","description":"Target daily calorie intake"}},"type":"object","required":["bmr","tdee","target_calories"],"title":"HealthMetricsResponse","description":"Health metrics calculated by AI"},"MacroPriority":{"type":"string","enum":["low","medium","high"],"title":"MacroPriority","description":"Macro nutrient priority levels"},"MealItem":{"properties":{"meal_type":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealType","description":"Type of meal"},"recipe_id":{"type":"string","title":"Recipe Id","description":"Recipe identifier"},"recipe_name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Recipe Name","description":"Recipe name"},"servings":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"title":"Servings","description":"Number of servings"},"estimated_calories":{"type":"number","title":"Estimated Calories","description":"Estimated calories for this meal"},"protein_g":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Protein G","description":"Protein in grams"},"carbs_g":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Carbs G","description":"Carbohydrates in grams"},"fat_g":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Fat G","description":"Fat in grams"}},"type":"object","required":["meal_type","recipe_id","servings","estimated_calories"],"title":"MealItem","description":"Single meal in the plan"},"MealPlan":{"properties":{"daily_calories":{"type":"number","title":"Daily Calories","description":"Total daily calories"},"meals":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealItem"},"type":"array","title":"Meals","description":"List of meals in the plan"},"total_protein_g":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Total Protein G","description":"Total daily protein"},"total_carbs_g":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Total Carbs G","description":"Total daily carbs"},"total_fat_g":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Total Fat G","description":"Total daily fat"}},"type":"object","required":["daily_calories","meals"],"title":"MealPlan","description":"Generated meal plan"},"MealPlanGenerationInput":{"properties":{"body_profile":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BodyProfile","description":"User's metabolic data"},"diet_constraints":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DietConstraints","description":"Diet constraints from Function 1"},"goal_profile":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GoalProfile","description":"Goal profile from Function 2"},"days":{"type":"integer","maximum":30.0,"minimum":1.0,"title":"Days","description":"Number of days to generate","default":1}},"type":"object","required":["body_profile","diet_constraints","goal_profile"],"title":"MealPlanGenerationInput","description":"Input for meal plan generation (Core function)"},"MealPlanGenerationOutput":{"properties":{"meal_plan":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MealPlan","description":"Generated personalized meal plan"},"metadata":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Metadata","description":"Additional metadata about generation"}},"type":"object","required":["meal_plan"],"title":"MealPlanGenerationOutput","description":"Output from meal plan generation"},"MealPlanPipelineRequest":{"properties":{"user_id":{"type":"string","title":"User Id","description":"User identifier"},"diet_types":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Diet Types","description":"Diet types"},"allergies":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Allergies","description":"Allergies"},"disliked_ingredients":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Disliked Ingredients","description":"Disliked ingredients"},"health_goal":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthGoalType","description":"Health objective"},"target_weight":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Weight","description":"Target weight in kg"},"timeline_weeks":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","maximum":52.0,"minimum":1.0},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Timeline Weeks","description":"Timeline in weeks"},"body_profile":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BodyProfile"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Body profile from upstream 'Analyze User Profile' function (PREFERRED)"},"bmr":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Bmr","description":"Basal Metabolic Rate (fallback)"},"tdee":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Tdee","description":"Total Daily Energy Expenditure (fallback)"},"weight_kg":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0.0},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Weight Kg","description":"Current weight (fallback)"},"height_cm":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0.0},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Height Cm","description":"Height in cm (fallback)"},"age":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","maximum":120.0,"minimum":1.0},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Age","description":"Age (fallback)"},"gender":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Gender","description":"Gender (fallback)"},"activity_level":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Activity Level","description":"Activity level (fallback)"},"days":{"type":"integer","maximum":30.0,"minimum":1.0,"title":"Days","description":"Number of days","default":1}},"type":"object","required":["user_id","health_goal"],"title":"MealPlanPipelineRequest","description":"Complete pipeline request combining all inputs.\n\nINTEGRATION WITH UPSTREAM:\n- Accepts body_profile directly from 'Analyze User Profile' function\n- Individual fields (bmr, tdee, etc.) are optional fallback\n- Prefer using body_profile when available (already calculated upstream)"},"MealPlanPipelineResponse":{"properties":{"user_id":{"type":"string","title":"User Id","description":"User identifier"},"diet_constraints":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DietConstraints","description":"Analyzed diet constraints"},"goal_profile":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GoalProfile","description":"Analyzed goal profile"},"meal_plan":